WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.644 --> 00:00:02.771
- Breakups suck, but they're
not the end of the world.

00:00:02.771 --> 00:00:05.493
There are going to be plenty
of more fish in the sea,

00:00:05.493 --> 00:00:07.647
so don't trip over one small one.

00:00:07.647 --> 00:00:10.230
(upbeat music)

00:00:12.394 --> 00:00:14.287
- That everything was gonna be okay.

00:00:14.287 --> 00:00:16.053
You're allowed to do well on the test,

00:00:16.053 --> 00:00:17.820
but you're also allowed to fail sometimes,

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:19.329
and you just keep going.

00:00:19.329 --> 00:00:21.699
- To not be afraid to be yourself,

00:00:21.699 --> 00:00:24.299
because back in the day, I was very shy,

00:00:24.299 --> 00:00:25.630
and I was very reserved.

00:00:25.630 --> 00:00:27.553
I didn't get to do a lot of things

00:00:27.553 --> 00:00:30.616
that I wished I got to do,
just because of my shyness.

00:00:30.616 --> 00:00:32.769
- The problems you think you're having

00:00:32.769 --> 00:00:34.798
are like not a big deal,

00:00:34.798 --> 00:00:36.434
like most of these problems are gonna

00:00:36.434 --> 00:00:38.243
work themselves out with age.

00:00:38.243 --> 00:00:40.061
- In high school, I was
always scared of doing

00:00:40.061 --> 00:00:41.738
the wrong thing or getting in trouble,

00:00:41.738 --> 00:00:44.315
but now I know that it's not that deep,

00:00:44.315 --> 00:00:46.790
so go do something you're scared of.

00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:48.663
- You should not be afraid,
as cheesy as it sounds,

00:00:48.663 --> 00:00:49.940
to chase a dream.

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:51.769
That anything is possible.

00:00:51.769 --> 00:00:54.464
You really should just
like follow your heart,

00:00:54.464 --> 00:00:56.422
move away, explore the world,

00:00:56.422 --> 00:00:58.253
do whatever you want, and
don't feel like you're stuck

00:00:58.253 --> 00:00:59.957
wherever you are.

00:00:59.957 --> 00:01:01.576
- In high school, I used
to get made fun of a lot

00:01:01.576 --> 00:01:03.171
for making YouTube videos,

00:01:03.171 --> 00:01:06.967
so back then I wish that
I knew to just not get

00:01:06.967 --> 00:01:08.273
discouraged by that.

00:01:08.273 --> 00:01:10.657
- I wish I knew that you
could take a gap year

00:01:10.657 --> 00:01:12.784
between high school in college.

00:01:12.784 --> 00:01:14.137
- College is really expensive,

00:01:14.137 --> 00:01:16.440
so missing out on some
parties and actually

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:19.413
doing good on your SATs is a good idea.

00:01:19.413 --> 00:01:20.569
- Also, save your money.

00:01:20.569 --> 00:01:22.908
If you have some type of
income in high school,

00:01:22.908 --> 00:01:26.451
at least save five bucks in a bank account

00:01:26.451 --> 00:01:29.354
so you have money to your name
when you get into college,

00:01:29.354 --> 00:01:31.012
and then in adulthood.

00:01:31.012 --> 00:01:32.588
Also, it's just like a good practice

00:01:32.588 --> 00:01:34.014
to have under your belt.

00:01:34.014 --> 00:01:35.282
- I'm gonna switch it up a little bit.

00:01:35.282 --> 00:01:37.389
There are some things I
wish I knew in high school

00:01:37.389 --> 00:01:39.169
that I still don't know,

00:01:39.169 --> 00:01:41.283
like how to change a tire,

00:01:41.283 --> 00:01:44.550
or how to do taxes, or just be an adult.

00:01:44.550 --> 00:01:47.133
(upbeat music)

